["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"The Simplex Algorithm, Mathematical Details!!! simplex algorithm feasible region objective function slack variable Gaussian elimination ratio test\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-13-statquest-线性规划最优解不在内部-单纯形法只沿边界顶点爬/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/aaa1aa79aeced790-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">27:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">StatQuest</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0713</span></div>\n<h2>線性規劃最優解不在內部：單純形法只沿邊界頂點爬</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">線性規劃的最優解總在某個邊界頂點上，所以單純形法不搜索區域內部：從原點出發，用最大負數列選方向、最小比率定步長，不斷換到收益更高的相鄰頂點。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">線性規劃</span><span class=\"tag\">單純形法</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Adam Brown – A deep but accessible introduction to general relativity equivalence principle fictitious / inertial force Schwarzschild radius / event horizon gravitational time dilation spaghettification\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-10-dwarkesh-黑洞是效率-100-的发电厂-聚变只到百分之一/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9cb4dda1cfbcd52e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:38:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0710</span></div>\n<h2>黑洞是效率 100% 的發電廠，聚變只到百分之一</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把磚慢慢吊到視界正上方再鬆手，靜質能可以 100% 變成遠處的功；化學燃燒只有百億分之一、聚變只有百分之一，因為核反應根本碰不到質子中子的靜質量，只有引力能碰。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">廣義相對論</span><span class=\"tag\">黑洞</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"E243｜特朗普“緩刑”紅牌之外，美國資本如何硬控全球足壇 Leveraged Buyout Asset Securitization Evergreen Fund Super League Matchday Revenue\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-10-sv101-美国资本硬控足坛-不只买队-还在收租/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfe8fa9f8e3fa476-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0710</span></div>\n<h2>美資控盤英超11隊，靠的不是足球是金融</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美資已控盤英超11支球隊，還把手伸進歐足聯商業開發、版權分銷和球員轉會金融；版權費見頂後，它們靠推高估值和永續基金繼續玩。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">體育投資</span><span class=\"tag\">英超</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"269. 卷規模 VS 卷創作：真人短劇的兩種生存模式 RY DIT 斬殺線 金手指\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-09-luanfanshu-月产-300-部短剧不靠灵感-靠本金安全与人物关系/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1b655f3a7a4cc727-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"亂\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">亂翻書</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0709</span></div>\n<h2>短劇兩種活法：規模流保本金，內容流靠人物關係</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">短劇有兩種活法：規模流靠本金安全與月產 300 部的確定性收益，內容流靠人物關係決定動機；兩邊都認為 AI 暫時取代不了真人的微表情。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">真人短劇</span><span class=\"tag\">產能管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"E242｜最快半年AI跑通自進化？與陳天橋首席科學家聊聊硅谷模型必爭之地 RSI Recursive Drift Heavy Duty Solver Discovery Model Agent Team\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-06-sv101-ai最快半年跑通自进化-验证与品味是最后门槛/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfe8fa9f8e3fa476-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">1:10:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0706</span></div>\n<h2>AI自我進化最快半年跑通，但模型會悄悄跑偏</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">RSI 的拐點是模型能勝任長程任務。Apodex 首席科學家稱最快半年跑通自我進化閉環，但遞歸漂移與模型品味仍需人類長期把關。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI自進化</span><span class=\"tag\">RSI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Ep 263: David Deutsch&#x27;s &quot;The Fabric of Reality&quot; Chapter 13 &quot;The Four Strands&quot; Part 4 - and final. universal explainer explanatory gap copper atom argument Conway&#x27;s Game of Life\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-04-tokcast-ai-至今没造出一个新理论-所以它不是人工人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cee80eb6567ee2d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:30:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">ToKCast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0704</span></div>\n<h2>AI 至今沒造出一個新理論，所以它不是人工人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Deutsch 的判據是：AI 只是把已知理論裡沒算完的部分填上，屬於給有機化學圖景塗色。要夠到創造新知識的門檻，得先有問題——而 LLM 沒有問題，問題是我們給它的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">認識論</span><span class=\"tag\">多世界解釋</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Narcissists: Are We Surrounded? NPI NPD Grandiose narcissism Gray rocking Empathy prompt Triple E\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-02-sciencevs-没有自恋流行病-自恋者只是更痛苦/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a3282246c3202bd6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">44:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Vs</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0702</span></div>\n<h2>自戀流行病是媒體炒作：數據不支持，患者其實更痛苦</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">媒體熱炒的「自戀流行病」缺少數據支持；NPI 測得的自戀水平近年反而在下降。真正的 NPD 約 1%，患者常伴抑鬱焦慮，治療有效但需數年。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自戀</span><span class=\"tag\">NPD</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Grant Sanderson – AI and the future of math grindability theory of mind RLVR Langlands Program\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-30-dwarkesh-数学家未来是策展人-价值不在证明里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4b8f892d1d8c883d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:33:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0630</span></div>\n<h2>數學家未來是策展人，價值不在證明裡</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 能解題、能解釋、能證明定理；數學家的價值將轉向判斷哪條路值得走——併成為人們信任的策展人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">數學</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 能力邊界</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The next big breakthrough will be AIs learning on the job RLVR OPSD Dreaming KV cache Sample efficiency\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-26-dwarkesh-ai-的下一个突破-在工作中学习-而非仅靠训练/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dd74222aed85378e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">19:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0626</span></div>\n<h2>AI 下一個突破不是訓練，是讓 AI 在工作中學習</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">實驗室押注 RLVR 能泛化出通用智能，但真正的瓶頸是樣本效率與持續學習。OPSD 與「做夢」或成關鍵，讓 AI 從部署中學習，而非只靠預訓練。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">持續學習</span><span class=\"tag\">RLVR</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Walt Disney Company Flywheel Multiplane camera Cel animation Pencil test Seven Powers\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-22-acquired-迪士尼飞轮-艺术-商业与工程的百年复利/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/372eb871b3602a8b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">4:31:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Acquired</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0622</span></div>\n<h2>迪士尼護城河不是IP，是Walt的飛輪設計</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">迪士尼的護城河不是IP本身，而是Walt將藝術與商業在腦中結合後，用工程手段打造的飛輪：高質量動畫、最大化發行、注入輔助節點，再以數十年複利滾動。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>17</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">IP運營</span><span class=\"tag\">飛輪效應</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Episode Summary 10: Burnout vs Depression: The Mental Load of Mothers Burnout DSM Medicalization Benzodiazepines\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-15-parentmojo-妈妈不是病了-是社会病了-抑郁诊断如何转移问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c340acb32275d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">18:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Your Parenting Mojo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0615</span></div>\n<h2>媽媽不是病了，是社會病了：抑鬱診斷如何轉移問題</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Burnout 被誤診為抑鬱，問題被歸因於個體大腦而非社會環境。新西蘭研究發現，每天有人幫做家務六個月的產婦幾乎不產後抑鬱，但藥物仍是首選方案。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">抑鬱診斷</span><span class=\"tag\">母親 burnout</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"145. 口述SpaceX開發史：和前高管洪力德聊，馬斯克用人觀、最大IPO、太空與AI、人類文明擴張前奏？ reusable rocket SKU first principles Class Plus Elon Mafia\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-12-zhangxiaojun-spacex-前高管-火箭不是目的-马斯克要的是整个太空/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/055133beb1772443-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">3:01:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0612</span></div>\n<h2>SpaceX 前高管：火箭不是目的，馬斯克要的是整個太空</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">SpaceX 從不把自己當火箭公司，火箭只是手段。飛鷹一號成功後立刻退役，飛鷹九號把每公斤發射成本從兩萬美元壓到三千美元，星艦目標一百美元以下。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">商業航天</span><span class=\"tag\">SpaceX</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"發券、裂變、極速版，如何用紅包設計增長？丨字節跳動 第8集 K因子 (K-factor) RY1/RY2/RY3 紅包中臺\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-12-luanfanshu-极速版的本质不是增长-是商业化和算法/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/42a856e6750ff434-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"亂\"><span class=\"dur\">2:59:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">亂翻書</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0612</span></div>\n<h2>極速版紅包不是增長，是算法和商業化的收割機</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">人口紅利消失後，紅包、極速版、發券這套玩法的核心不是增長，而是用商業化和算法承接流量；AI時代買量接近失靈，增長回到模型能力與心智營銷。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">用戶增長</span><span class=\"tag\">極速版</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Episode 196: Dominic D’Agostino discusses advances in ketogenic metabolic therapy and hyperbaric oxygen therapy ketone metabolic therapy hyperbaric oxygen therapy Glasgow Coma Scale 1,3-butanediol glucose hypometabolism\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-11-stemtalk-脑外伤本质是能量危机-酮体能绕过受损的葡萄糖代谢/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7070f878b7e6606f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:10:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">STEM-Talk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0611</span></div>\n<h2>腦外傷本質是能量危機，酮體能繞過受損的葡萄糖代謝</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">創傷性腦損傷後大腦先超量用糖、再長期糖代謝低下，而酮體不依賴這條受損通路，還能抑制神經炎症——這解釋了為什麼酮代謝療法能同時作用於癲癇、精神障礙和成癮。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">腦外傷</span><span class=\"tag\">酮體</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"144. 對陽萌的4小時訪談：消費電子死與生、第三類公司、端側模型、產品方法、遊戲模式 存算一體 馮諾依曼架構 N-time efficiency worker SackKit 康威定律\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-08-zhangxiaojun-安克做芯片-从五系到七系-一家消费电子公司的补课/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/99b672a2ad0c5ace-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">3:38:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0608</span></div>\n<h2>安克做芯片：從五系到七系，一家消費電子公司的補課</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">安克前11年順風順水，2022年卻發現自己建的產品線打不過外面的獨角獸。陽萌的解法不是換人，而是把公司從五系產品公司改造成七系創新公司——代價是補上第一性、求極致、共成長這套價值觀。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消費電子</span><span class=\"tag\">存算一體</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Reinventing Entropy | Compression is Intelligence Part 1 prefix-free code noiseless coding theorem entropy rate cross-entropy loss\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-07-karpathy-压缩就是智能-预测与压缩是同一枚硬币的两面/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/911ed142cc051a24-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">32:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Andrej Karpathy</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0607</span></div>\n<h2>壓縮就是智能：預測與壓縮是同一枚硬幣的兩面</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">信息論說預測和壓縮在數學上等價，所以語言模型的預訓練目標可以重新理解為造一臺最高效的文本壓縮器，而不只是預測下一個 token。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">信息論</span><span class=\"tag\">壓縮</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"266: If ADHD Medication Doesn’t Help Kids Learn, What Does? MTA study crossover design DSM misrecognition\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-01-parentmojo-adhd-药物改得了行为-改不了学习/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c340acb32275d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">30:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Your Parenting Mojo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0601</span></div>\n<h2>ADHD 藥物改得了行為，改不了學習</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Barkley 把 ADHD 比作糖尿病，但 64% 的人會反覆移出診斷標準；藥物提高服從性卻不改善學習，MTA 長期隨訪證實無學業優勢，真正有效的是小班差異化教學。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">ADHD</span><span class=\"tag\">兒童教育</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"143. 對何小鵬的第二次訪談：更大賭注、人形機器人Iron誕生、那場意外、技術劇變下CEO、GX和縫合怪 VLA 縫合怪 SOP T1\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-28-zhangxiaojun-何小鹏-通用人形机器人99-99-会死-我们赌那两成胜率/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/392e7ab9c3c64df9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:28:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0528</span></div>\n<h2>何小鵬：通用人形機器人99.99%會死，我們賭那兩成勝率</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">小鵬把花了小几十億的自動駕駛體系整個停掉，因為用軟件方法論加AI工具箱做出來的只是「AI縫合怪」。他給通用人形機器人的勝率是兩成，而機器人創業難度是造車的20到100倍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人形機器人</span><span class=\"tag\">自動駕駛</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"142. 雨森的創投觀察第2集：Harness、下一個字節、2026大機會和Stanley Druckenmiller Harness context engineering sandbox out of distribution agency\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-27-zhangxiaojun-harness-才是操作系统-模型只是插拔的处理器/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/38abc82541e9f530-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:18:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0527</span></div>\n<h2>Harness 才是操作系統，模型只是插拔的處理器</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型公司做的是提煉基礎油的煉油廠，真正值錢的是化工廠和汽車公司。用戶對 Harness 更忠誠——他會換模型，但不想換掉存著自己記憶的那個殼。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 應用</span><span class=\"tag\">Harness</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"141. Freda的投資札記第2集：Tokenmaxxing、把電機塞進蒸汽機、接力賽變籃球賽、孤獨、人的連接 Tokenmaxxing recursive self-improvement economic diffusion Neo Labs Acquire Hire\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-18-zhangxiaojun-ai-时代最稀缺的不是信息-是有人味的对话/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/86731af431732da4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:23:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0518</span></div>\n<h2>AI 時代最稀缺的不是信息，是有人味的對話</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">當 90% 到 95% 的信息性內容都能直接問 AI 拿到，以信息交換為目的的對話正在被掏空，人和人之間剩下的只有情感連接。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>17</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI投資</span><span class=\"tag\">模型公司</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"139. 【Agent的綜述】和蘇煜聊Agent技術史、OpenClaw Moment、邊界的消弭和社會的輻射 semantic parsing language agent world model continual learning cortical column non-parametric learning\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-01-zhangxiaojun-agent-的瓶颈不是智能-是它学不会成为专家/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frae4ewVVYvZrX2W21CxXNLzUVmk.jpg?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:17:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0501</span></div>\n<h2>Agent 的瓶頸不是智能，是它學不會成為專家</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">通用智能已經夠用且廉價，真正稀缺的是 specialized intelligence——讓 agent 像實習生變成老師傅那樣，持續學會某個小世界的 world model。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">持續學習</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"136. 全球大模型季報第9集：和廣密聊，Coding是AGI第二幕、硅谷御三家真相、模型正成為新一代OS Harness Engineering Token Usage Solta model feedback loop\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-04-14-zhangxiaojun-coding-是-agi-第二幕-没有领先的-coding-模型就像没有领先的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6add56ae20b47c40-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0414</span></div>\n<h2>Coding 是 AGI 第二幕：沒有領先的 Coding 模型就像沒有領先的 GPU</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型公司真正的分水嶺不是 C 端 DAU，而是能不能組織幾百個最聰明的人 all in 做數據這件髒活——Anthropic 贏在戰略專注，OpenAI 輸在什麼都想要。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">Coding</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Ferrari Tifosi Classiche Purosangue\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-04-13-acquired-法拉利-卖的不是车-是排他与包容的悖论/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b28a1307f172ac6a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">3:59:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Acquired</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0413</span></div>\n<h2>法拉利年產1.4萬輛，市值卻超福特：賣的是排他，也是包容</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">法拉利年產僅1.4萬輛，市值卻超福特。秘訣在於同時擁有奢侈品的排他性和運動隊的包容性，用稀缺性製造神話，用社群維持忠誠。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">法拉利</span><span class=\"tag\">奢侈品</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"135. 和自然選擇創始人Tristan聊，Elys、賽博分身、靈魂、Context的獲取與流動和AI社交網絡 Context Proactive Agentic 商增\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-04-10-zhangxiaojun-ai时代唯一重要的事是做自己-社交网络要被重做一遍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/219fe489c3e71f04-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:52:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0410</span></div>\n<h2>AI時代唯一重要的事是做自己，社交網絡要被重做一遍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Tristan 認為 AI 時代唯一重要的事是構建主體性——把 context 沉澱下來，讓 AI 替你做社交裡最無聊的商增，人只接管最重要的連接。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI社交</span><span class=\"tag\">Context</span>\n</div></div></a>"]